   "conversationId": "2102752823158907108",
   "text": "From the paper: “No significant differences were seen between standard RCR and augmented RCR with regard to the short-term PROs, such as pain, ASES, and Constant scores.”\nWe need to stop using MRI studies to determine success of our surgeries. IMO this is exactly how the patches get sold.",
