   "conversationId": "2102740323709366510",
   "text": "We looked at hundreds of my ACLs when I was at Baylor BTB Auto vs TA Fresh Frozen allos. Avg 27yo, Tegner 7, followed for 5 years. Handful of retears. Higher in the BTB group. I get asked all the time what I am doing different. Above is what I do. I now have over 20y follow up on some patients and seeing their own kids which is fun.",
