   "url": "https://x.com/txsportsdoc/status/2102880802988023822",
   "conversationId": "2102490008246690149",
   "text": "How many people spend 30k every year out of pocket on healthcare…only a very small percentage and you could easily create a seperate risk pool just for them.\nThats the whole ins game and how they make 10s of billions and why Warren Buffet loves INs co…the float. Simple math, take as much money as you possibly can from your members and pay out as little as possible.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-23T22:00:27.000Z",
