   "url": "https://x.com/txsportsdoc/status/2102813774075859396",
   "conversationId": "2102490008246690149",
   "text": "I think many consider: Trauma, MI,unplanned surgery,cancer catastrophic and those represent less than 1% of medical visits in the US. Again, Median spend less than $500 annually, not the avg $30k annual spend someone must pay for the plastic card that then gives u a “discount” for on network care that is often much more than cash price. Again, you can create a subsidy for the unexpected and those in need. Simply bring back catastrophic plans and expand HSAs…easy fix. I can solve it over the weekend",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-23T17:34:06.000Z",
