   "url": "https://x.com/txsportsdoc/status/2102812835529007246",
   "conversationId": "2102490008246690149",
   "text": "Access is everywhere. Walk in the door. Cash is still king. Someone saving thousands/month on expensive premiums can pay as they go. You don’t make a car insurance claim for an oil change, or home owners claim for a broken sprinkler or window…you just pay for it. The plastic card doesn’t give you access, it’s capture and extracts money without returning real value/care for its members",
