   "conversationId": "2102752823158907108",
   "text": "Orthos: Why are we seeing so many colleagues put patches on partial rotator cuff tears? The enormous cost this adds to these cases is sometimes $4k with little clinical benefit. Been doing shoulder surgery for about 25yrs never once used one for a partial tear and maybe a few times to augment a full thickness tear. It seems the industry tail wagging the dog again.",
