   "id": "2102750351942177057",
   "url": "https://x.com/txsportsdoc/status/2102750351942177057",
   "conversationId": "2102750351942177057",
   "text": "Need to immediately repeal all remaining portions of Obamacare. What many people don’t know is brokers receive incentives for signing up people on Obamacare and no one verifies their credentials and or if they are real people. I don’t know what many of us simple people see the problem and the solution and yet we keep holding pressers as if we are surprised. Imagine what we could actually do if real tax dollars were going to help real people. We could actually raise Medicare/Medicaid rates to doctors thereby improving access and care. Fund people not programs.",
